      "content": "lattice lungs?? i've never heard of that. and i mean i get doctors to go to and stuff but i'm mostly just trying to fix this right now so i don't keep feeling it. if i just took a couple more Tums or maybe some of that liquid antacid stuff, would that be enough to settle it down? it feels so much like reflux though.",
